{% doc %}
  @prompt
    请创建一个 Shopify Online Store 2.0 自定义 Section，名称为 Main Benefits Icons。
    
    请参考我的 Figma 设计稿，实现一个简洁、现代、轻量的「三个核心卖点 Icon」组件。
    
    布局要求
    
    * 组件整体居中显示。
    * 顶部显示一个居中的标题。
    * 标题下方显示一排 3 个卖点 Icon。
    * 每个 Icon 下方显示一段说明文字。
    * 移动端和 PC 端都保持 一排三个，不要换行，也不要做成轮播。
    * 整个组件不要铺满屏幕，保持合适的最大宽度，居中展示。
    
    Section 设置
    
    请支持以下后台可编辑内容：
    
    * 标题文字
    * 标题字号（移动端 / PC 端）
    * 标题颜色
    * 标题与 Icon 区域之间的间距
    * 组件最大宽度
    * 上下 Padding（移动端 / PC 端）
    * 背景颜色
    * Icon 大小（移动端 / PC 端）
    * Icon 之间的间距（移动端 / PC 端）
    * Icon 与文字之间的间距
    * 文字字号（移动端 / PC 端）
    * 文字颜色
    
    Block 设置
    
    使用 Blocks，每个 Block 代表一个 Benefit Item。
    
    默认创建 3 个 Block，最多允许 3 个。
    
    每个 Block 支持：
    
    * 上传 Icon（SVG、PNG、JPG）
    * Icon Alt 文本
    * Icon 下方说明文字（支持多行）
    * 可选跳转链接
    * 显示 / 隐藏开关
    
    移动端要求
    
    * 始终保持一排三个 Item。
    * 每个 Item 等宽排列。
    * Icon 使用 contain 显示，不能裁切。
    * 文字居中，可自动换行。
    * 左右保留适当安全边距。
    * 整体视觉尽量接近 Figma。
    
    PC 端要求
    
    * 保持一排三个。
    * 相比移动端等比例放大。
    * 保持整体居中，不要拉满整屏。
    * 风格简洁、现代、有高级感。
    
    样式要求
    
    * 使用 Shopify Liquid、HTML、CSS 和少量 JavaScript。
    * 不依赖任何外部库。
    * 不使用 Tailwind。
    * 输出完整的 Shopify Section 文件，可直接放入 sections 文件夹使用。
    * CSS 使用 Section ID 做作用域，避免影响其他页面。
    * 整体需要响应式，不允许移动端横向溢出。
    
    默认内容
    
    标题：
    MAIN BENEFITS
    
    三个默认卖点：
    
    * Seamless Comfort
    * Sculpted Control-top
    * Powered by Soflume Tech
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .main-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .main-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px 40px;
    }
  }

  .main-benefits-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .main-benefits-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_mobile }}px;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing }}px 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .main-benefits-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .main-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.icon_gap_mobile }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .main-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.icon_gap_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .main-benefits-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_text_spacing }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.icon_size_desktop }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.icon_size_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size_mobile }}px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
    word-wrap: break-word;
    hyphens: auto;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .main-benefits-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: block;
  }

  .main-benefits-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="main-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="main-benefits-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
      <h2 class="main-benefits-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="main-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.benefit_1_enabled %}
        <div class="main-benefits-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.benefit_1_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.benefit_1_link }}" class="main-benefits-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.benefit_1_icon != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ block.settings.benefit_1_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                    alt="{{ block.settings.benefit_1_icon_alt | escape }}"
                    class="main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="200"
                    height="200"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Icon</div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              {% if block.settings.benefit_1_text != blank %}
                <p class="main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_1_text }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.benefit_1_icon != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ block.settings.benefit_1_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                  alt="{{ block.settings.benefit_1_icon_alt | escape }}"
                  class="main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="200"
                  height="200"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Icon</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% if block.settings.benefit_1_text != blank %}
              <p class="main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_1_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.benefit_2_enabled %}
        <div class="main-benefits-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.benefit_2_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.benefit_2_link }}" class="main-benefits-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.benefit_2_icon != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ block.settings.benefit_2_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                    alt="{{ block.settings.benefit_2_icon_alt | escape }}"
                    class="main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="200"
                    height="200"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Icon</div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              {% if block.settings.benefit_2_text != blank %}
                <p class="main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_2_text }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.benefit_2_icon != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ block.settings.benefit_2_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                  alt="{{ block.settings.benefit_2_icon_alt | escape }}"
                  class="main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="200"
                  height="200"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Icon</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% if block.settings.benefit_2_text != blank %}
              <p class="main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_2_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.benefit_3_enabled %}
        <div class="main-benefits-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.benefit_3_link != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.benefit_3_link }}" class="main-benefits-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.benefit_3_icon != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ block.settings.benefit_3_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                    alt="{{ block.settings.benefit_3_icon_alt | escape }}"
                    class="main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="200"
                    height="200"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Icon</div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              {% if block.settings.benefit_3_text != blank %}
                <p class="main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_3_text }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="main-benefits-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.benefit_3_icon != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ block.settings.benefit_3_icon | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                  alt="{{ block.settings.benefit_3_icon_alt | escape }}"
                  class="main-benefits-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="200"
                  height="200"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="main-benefits-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Icon</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% if block.settings.benefit_3_text != blank %}
              <p class="main-benefits-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.benefit_3_text }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

